	(text
		"CDTP denge robotu - robot elektronigi (tek sayfa). Ayni adli etiketler ayni hattir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 256.54 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "641c9472-3739-570f-966f-4e0c194411ab")
	)
	(text
		"Guc: pil -> BMS -> XT60 -> F1 5 A -> WAGO-12V. Acil stop (NC) yalniz motor hattini keser; ESP32 acik kalir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 259.08 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9376b53f-adda-5ed1-ad87-2065f3b74f8c")
	)
	(text
		"KAPSAM: yalniz dengede kalan, pilli robot. GENISLEME konnektorleri (J6, J7, J9, J13) bos birakildi; sarj, IR goz, ekran sonradan buraya takilir."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "351b7e57-0b84-5769-bb82-f1b93cbafecd")
	)
	(text
		"Sarj eklentisi (sonra): pogo + -> SR5100 anot, katot -> BAT+ (sigortadan once), pogo + ayrica J9-2. R3/R4 GPIO34'u 0 V'ta tutar."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 265.43 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d23b58d6-d64e-5d34-b91e-44bacb26098d")
	)
	(text
		"JP1: kod yuklerken (USB takiliyken) cikarin; LM2596 ile USB 5 V'u cakismasin."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 269.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3816502e-a1ba-51fc-9a22-d13d84deecd5")
	)
	(text
		"BTS7960 VCC = 3,3 V (ESP32 seviyesi). R_EN ve L_EN iki kartta GPIO4'e; R5 10k ile acilista motorlar kapali."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 271.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3436e5b2-31cf-5865-a251-3e0fb9f4b91d")
	)
	(text
		"MPU6050 AD0 -> GND (adres 0x68). GPIO36/39 yalniz giris (IR, PCNT 12,8 us suzgec)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 275.59 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "2306af42-b7a0-5539-8b12-212af28ec848")
	)
	(text
		"Bolucu: R1/R2 ve R3/R4 100k/27k (12,6 V -> 2,68 V); R6/R7 100k/33k (12,6 V -> 3,13 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 278.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "182699f7-df4d-5a8b-b322-e2529ca141f0")
	)
	(text
		"Kablo numaralari (W1-W44) ve pin sirasi: docs/robot.html bolum 04, 06, 07."
